<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Rotate Reset：空默认项的完整源码链与实施候选</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="../index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../../plugins/ROTATE-CALIBRATION-RESET-SOURCE-CANDIDATE.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="rotate-reset空默认项的完整源码链与实施候选">Rotate Reset：空默认项的完整源码链与实施候选</h1><p>2026-10-19。静态取证，无Platform Init/设备/原厂UI reset执行；复用B身份匹配原件，不修改其项目。</p>
<h2 id="原默认项实际落到哪里">原默认项实际落到哪里</h2><p>安装RotateCalibModuAlgorithm.xml有效唯一ParamItem是FilePath、DefaultValue空。ModuleFrame SHA45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b。原导出复用analysis/camera-mapping/b3-reset-source-20261019/frame：141ee0→581e0→125100→e5cb0→e8220。空DefaultValue留初始化空串，但仍插pair-vector，无跳过；默认正常写经42760。其原指令429a8..429c6给SetParam实际this/name/value/strlen(value)，不是len+1；失败最后非零保EBP，继续后42a45返回。</p>
<p>Rotate自身ctor372c0的原指令372e2/372e9把vtable18004ec78写this；该PE+18槽地址18004ec90原8bytes指向180038980 SetParam。新增纯被动PE数据在analysis/rotate-calibration/final-audit/reset-vtable.json，原module-disasm.txt保全部dumpbin原指令；模块hash b08486b8481ed6d7774634b30b5cae167f85b911ebf394122663bab400a9bb41。</p>
<p>SetParam38980入口明确param3!=0才处理；空默认长度0直接返回0xe0000001，不触及FilePath/矩阵有效/矩阵字节/采样/RevOutputFlag。复用B RETURN-SOURCE闭合Frame→Proxy响应errorCode→Manager Err*code→SDK恢复错误→托管VmException→普通Reset按钮catch；正常SP响应路径错误不被序列化成功吞掉。因唯一默认失败，不执行成功刷新/成功通知；之前IsSubA=false解绑不回滚。不是实际桌面操作记录。</p>
<h2 id="候选与验证入口">候选与验证入口</h2><p>analysis/rotate-calibration/proposals/reset/rotate-reset-source-list.patch SHA8cec01e798e404b464b511623ada4302ac781df163da55cff0e004a57af71bc2，普通git apply --check通过。未应用/未构建，src冻结。</p>
<p>共享CalibrationToolConfigurationProvider只新增可选algorithmResetResource；有值时调用既有公共ToolConfigurationAlgorithmReset，不另写解绑循环。Rotate传原resource，增加专属CheckResetParameter空FilePath门返回E0000001；该门在默认写时才用，不改常规文件编辑。未传可选参数的Translation调用/旧行为不变。原资源显式EmbeddedResource（项目非XML通配）。同步宿主有效值供解绑后保留，不清缓存。</p>
<p>tests/RotateCalibration.ResetChecks仅ProjectReference生产，检查两实际ISubInfo按序解绑、取消、不调用Atomic/Run、非名单InputWay/RevOutput保留、默认空路径拒绝/错误无成功通知、矩阵/采样/path/关闭配置保留与显式Reset移除。tests/RotateCalibration.LifecycleChecks检查正常采样→打开关闭配置→Reset及scope独立/RemoveNode。二者均未构建。随后重放旧RotateCalibration.Checks原数值/状态/文件/显示/WPF必要集；旧1259只是历史数量，以本次实际日志为准。</p>
